{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32053","headline":"黎阳寄姚合 · 贾岛","name":"黎阳寄姚合","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"魏都城里曾游熟，才子斋中止泊多。\n去日绿杨垂紫陌，归时白草夹黄河。\n新诗不觉千回咏，古镜曾经几度磨。\n惆怅心思滑台北，满杯浓酒与愁和。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}